{"abstract":"The impact of this chapter is to inform the reader of this book about current activities of international bodies to improve the methods used in exposure assessment and the knowledge and information database. In addition the reader shall be given insight into the regulatory work and decision procedures.","author_count":17,"contributors":["Ahrens, Andreas","Bessems, Jos","Bruinen de Bruin, Yuri","Connolly, Alison","Fantke, Peter","Gilsenan, Mary","Heinemeyer, Gerhard","Jantunen, Matti","Lahaniatis, Majlinda","Papameletiou, Demosthenes","Radomyski, Artur","Reina, Vittorio","Schlüter, Urs","Sommer, Yasmin","Theobald, Anne","von Goetz, Natalie","Zenié, Alexandre"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-358424"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Heinemeyer, Gerhard"],"country":["Belgium","Finland","Germany","Ireland","Italy","Switzerland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","European Chemicals Agency","European Commission Joint Research Centre Institute","European Food Safety Authority","Federal Institute for Risk Assessment","ISES-Europe Board","National Institute for Health and Welfare","National University of Ireland","Swiss Federal Institute of Technology Zurich","VITO Health"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"activities encountered by european and other international authorities","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/203789785/Ahrens_2019a.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-358424","identifier":[{"id":"85084879241","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-b4365f3f-bae0-4f93-948c-beea34637908"],"lang":"English","