{"abstract":"We present a study on lookahead hierarchies for restarting automata with auxiliary symbols and small lookahead. In particular, we show that there are just two different classes of languages recognised by RRWW automata, through the restriction of lookahead size. We also show that the respective (left-) monotone restarting automaton models characterise the context-free languages and that the respective right-left-monotone restarting automata characterise the linear languages both with just lookahead length 2.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Schluter, Natalie"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-381557"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Auxiliary Symbols","Context Free Languages","Linear Languages","Lookahead Hierarchies","Restarting Automata"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"restarting automata with auxiliary symbols and small lookahead","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85038037666","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-381557","identifier":[{"id":"85038037666","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-134df879-672c-46da-96db-9cf27e8ce65a"],"keyword":["Auxiliary Symbols","Context-Free Languages","Linear Languages","Lookahead Hierarchies","Restarting Automata"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3AE34C25F6BC3AC1071DEA6B8CFC917E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Cope